        width:${toPx(wLegacy)};
        z-index:9;">
        <img class="sprite" src="${src}" alt="${name} Appears">
      </div>`;
  }
  if (i === 14) {
    const src = getAnimalSrc('flying');
    if (!src) return `<div class="animal missing" data-missing="page14-flying"></div>`;
